Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.02,0:01:34.49,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(280,1)}{\fs20\pos(129,342)}Exclusive Seller of Eden Academy Uniforms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.99,0:01:42.20,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,And... 99.5.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.20,0:01:45.00,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm two millimeters bigger than last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.25,0:01:46.46,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's just an error.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:50.46,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,You never know. Kids grow up so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.46,0:01:51.50,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:55.21,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, with that in mind, we should probably \Nhave your uniform made a little bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:59.76,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,But it was quite a shock to hear that \Nyou were suddenly married, Yor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.76,0:02:04.22,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,You should have told me the \Nlast time you were here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:06.98,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm, er, sorry about the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:11.52,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,And to think that your lovely daughter is \Ngoing to the prestigious Eden College.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.52,0:02:12.98,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.98,0:02:14.48,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Fank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.32,0:02:18.11,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Are you an Eden College alum?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.11,0:02:21.16,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, no. I went to an insignificant \Nlittle school out in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:23.78,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Oh, then do be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.78,0:02:29.08,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,There's something of a wall between parents \Nwho are Eden alumni and those who aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:33.00,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Apparently this causes discrimination and \Nbullying among the children, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.97,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Oh, and hazing from the honor students,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.97,0:02:38.84,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,and conflict between the \Ndorm kids and commuters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.80,0:02:43.84,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Speaking of, I hear that kidnappings \Nof commuter kids are on the rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.84,0:02:47.77,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,It's not surprising, considering most of the \Nkids who can attend Eden are rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.18,0:02:50.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go to school anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.69,0:02:55.23,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry. I didn't mean to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:58.78,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Don't worry. There are plenty \Nof fun things about it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:00.40,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Okay, all done with your measurements.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.41,0:03:04.33,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Let's see, you'll be getting one uniform,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:08.00,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,plus a winter coat, a vest, and a sweater, \Nfor three additional items.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.00,0:03:11.25,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,You're a regular here, so I'll \Nget those done immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.67,0:03:15.67,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Oh, you'll be able to get everything else \Nyou need from the shop on the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:17.00,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This is going to cost more than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:23.59,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.59,0:03:25.64,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I am in fear that I will be kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:27.77,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. You sure didn't waste any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:31.69,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yor, is it all right if we eat out today?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.69,0:03:33.52,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.52,0:03:36.27,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Are there any kidnappers at the restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:38.86,main,Waiter,0,0,0,,Here's our special for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:44.78,main,Waiter,0,0,0,,Pork sauté in pawpaw sauce with \Nporcini mushrooms and potato potage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.57,0:03:46.41,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Po?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.41,0:03:47.49,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Looks delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.49,0:03:48.62,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Must be cipher P.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.29,0:03:51.29,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Ah, a notice about my briefing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.29,0:03:55.63,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It'll be in five days at \N1300 hours at safe house D.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:56.71,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.21,0:04:00.34,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But I really need to ask them to stop \Nusing this notification method.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:02.05,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,There's something unpleasant about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:05.51,sign_8129_90_3_Days_Later,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord2\3c&HFAF3F5&}5 Days Later
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.51,0:04:06.55,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.55,0:04:08.14,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.14,0:04:09.97,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What? It's done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.47,0:04:13.56,main,Loid,0,0,0,,All right. We'll come \Npick up the order today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.56,0:04:14.35,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.61,0:04:19.02,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Is the uniform done?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:20.53,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Sounds like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:23.78,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,But I have my briefing today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.28,0:04:25.78,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to trouble you, Yor,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.78,0:04:27.78,main,Loid,0,0,0,,but could you go pick \Nit up with Anya for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:30.12,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I got called into work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:33.91,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Of course. You can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:39.80,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I might not get home until late, so you \Ncan go ahead and get delivery for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.80,0:04:40.55,main,Yor,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:41.88,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Have a knees day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:19.29,sign_5367_29_Code_Name__Twili,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(275,1)}{\blur2}WISE Handler\NSylvia Sherwood\N{\fs25}Alias: Handler
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:19.84,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Good day... or perhaps \Ngood evening, Agent Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.73,0:05:23.34,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Hello, Handler. What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.67,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Before we get into that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.34,0:05:28.59,main,Handler,0,0,0,,What in the world were all \Nthose expenses the other day?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.59,0:05:31.35,main,Handler,0,0,0,,A castle rental fee, and rental fees \Nfor furniture to go in said castle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:33.23,main,Handler,0,0,0,,You think we're made of money?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.23,0:05:35.27,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Oh, here's a couple more bills, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.27,0:05:37.27,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Going to school is apparently very expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.27,0:05:39.94,main,Handler,0,0,0,,I have to admire the balls it takes to \Njust casually hand me more bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:42.15,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, they're all necessary expenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.15,0:05:44.23,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Very well. Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:48.91,main,Handler,0,0,0,,I'm here today to brief you \Non phase 2 of Operation Strix.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:51.74,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Though you're usually on the ball, \Nso that may not be necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:55.95,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Well... I may actually \Nbe off my game lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:58.71,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Phase 2 requires a social gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.71,0:06:02.46,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Before we get into the details, \Nlet's review how Eden works.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:04.55,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Eden College.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:07.01,main,Handler,0,0,0,,There are around 2,500 students
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.01,0:06:10.51,main,Handler,0,0,0,,ranging from the ages of six to nineteen, \Nand the curriculum covers all thirteen years.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.51,0:06:12.47,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Academics, sports, the arts...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.47,0:06:15.47,main,Handler,0,0,0,,They offer a top-class \Neducation in every field.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:19.44,main,Handler,0,0,0,,The students who manage to shine \Nbrighter than their fellow elites
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.44,0:06:22.98,main,Handler,0,0,0,,are the honor students known \Nas the Imperial Scholars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:25.99,main,Handler,0,0,0,,The social gathering that Desmond attends
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:30.36,main,Handler,0,0,0,,is only open to those Imperial \NScholars and their parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.36,0:06:32.49,main,Handler,0,0,0,,In order to become an Imperial Scholar,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:36.33,main,Handler,0,0,0,,a student must earn eight \Nmerits known as "Stella."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.33,0:06:40.37,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Stella Stars are awarded for exceptional \Ngrades and contributions to society.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.13,0:06:45.92,main,Handler,0,0,0,,Which means, first, you need to raise \Nyour daughter into an honor student.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:49.37,main,Handler,0,0,0,,You may use underhanded \Nmeans if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.85,0:06:51.30,main,Handler,0,0,0,,On the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.30,0:06:56.35,main,Handler,0,0,0,,poor grades and bad behavior will result \Nin demerits called Tonitrus Bolts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.35,0:06:59.27,main,Handler,0,0,0,,When a student receives eight of those, \Nthey will be immediately expelled,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:00.27,main,Handler,0,0,0,,so be aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.90,0:07:04.52,top,Handler,0,0,0,,Now, let's work out the finer details.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:04.98,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Turning that child into a honor student...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.03,0:07:08.28,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Hello, anxiety, my old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:14.87,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Do I look cute in my uniform?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:16.95,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, you look absolutely adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.95,0:07:18.66,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Let's go to the portrait studio later!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.08,0:07:22.08,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.67,0:07:24.13,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Do I look cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.13,0:07:26.80,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, you look absolutely adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:29.42,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Could you leave already? How many \Ntimes are you gonna say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:32.43,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I wanna go on an ooting in this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.43,0:07:33.80,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes, let's do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.89,0:07:37.22,main,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Thanks much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:41.44,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Doot, do! Doot, do! Doot, do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:43.60,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Why don't we stop by the park?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.40,0:07:47.86,main,Anya,0,0,0,,This is my uniform. Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:49.89,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I am wearing my uniform. Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.53,0:07:53.32,main,Mother A,0,0,0,,My, your daughter's adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.37,0:07:57.87,main,Mother B,0,0,0,,She goes to Eden? I'm so jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:00.37,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh... Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.37,0:08:02.67,main,Mother B's child,0,0,0,,Mom, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.12,0:08:05.08,main,Mother A,0,0,0,,And what would you like for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:06.67,main,Mother A's child,0,0,0,,Hamburg steak!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:12.68,flashback,Swan,0,0,0,,So you {\i1}do{\i0} prefer your old mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:14.76,flashback,Anya,0,0,0,,I want to be with them forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.05,0:08:20.02,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I know that we're just a pretend family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.89,0:08:21.68,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:27.40,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Maybe I could be more of a mother to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:30.19,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.36,0:08:34.45,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I just showed everyone how cute I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:37.62,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Make sure you don't dirty your \Nuniform before you go to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.45,0:08:42.29,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Say, Miss Anya. Why don't we stop \Nby the supermarket on our way home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:48.13,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid said he was going to be home \Nlate, so I'll make dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.13,0:08:48.84,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:50.50,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Can you cook, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:52.09,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Yes. I will do my very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:56.43,main,Thug A,0,0,0,,Hey, is that kid from Eden?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.43,0:08:56.97,main,Thug B,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.26,0:09:00.10,main,Thug A,0,0,0,,Is the chick next to her the mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:01.47,main,Thug B,0,0,0,,She's gotta be the hired help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.47,0:09:04.77,main,Thug B,0,0,0,,No rich person's gonna \Ngo shopping themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:08.11,main,Thug A,0,0,0,,You know, I think I want an allowance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:09.48,main,Thug B,0,0,0,,Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:14.99,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm sure I'll be able to make something \Nif I have some meat and vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:19.24,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what any of these are,\Nso I'll just buy all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.62,0:09:20.53,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:24.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm going outside now. I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:25.96,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, don't wander off too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:32.96,main,Thug A,0,0,0,,Hello there, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.96,0:09:35.59,main,Thug B,0,0,0,,Be a good girl for just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:39.26,main,Thug B,0,0,0,,Once your maid pays up, we'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:40.51,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:43.77,flashback,Proprietress,0,0,0,,Eden has bullying and kidnappings...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.43,0:09:46.48,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,She was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:51.94,main,Thug C,0,0,0,,I heard you can even sell their \Nuniforms for a sweet price.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.94,0:09:55.15,main,Thug B,0,0,0,,Excellent. In that case, \Nlittle lady, let's take your—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.95,0:10:02.61,main,Yor,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:07.12,main,Thug A,0,0,0,,Uh-oh! Looks like we're gonna have \Nto tack on some medical bills, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:09.08,main,Thug A,0,0,0,,Let's see your wallet, Miss Hired Help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.33,0:10:12.96,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I used up all of \Nmy cash, so I have none left.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:14.96,main,Yor,0,0,0,,So I must ask you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:19.30,main,Thug A,0,0,0,,I see. Then I guess we're just gonna \Nhave to strip the little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.30,0:10:22.43,main,Thug A,0,0,0,,You're gonna be fired anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:25.81,main,Thug A,0,0,0,,so go back to the countryside, \Nyou shitty little maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.94,0:10:31.19,main,Thug A,0,0,0,,Sh-She destroyed that pumpkin \Nwith her bare hand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.73,0:10:36.24,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I am that girl's mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:40.82,main,Yor,0,0,0,,If you do not want to end up like \Nthat vegetable, leave at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.62,0:10:43.87,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.12,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.54,0:10:50.92,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. I shouldn't have \Nlet you out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.92,0:10:52.17,main,Yor,0,0,0,,There, there...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:55.41,main,Yor,0,0,0,,And I've ruined all of the ingredients...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.41,0:10:57.76,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm such a failure as a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:06.27,main,Anya,0,0,0,,But I love that my Mama \Nis so strong and cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.27,0:11:07.31,main,Anya,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.31,0:11:10.31,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Killer punch, kapow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.66,0:11:12.77,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I-I'm so embarrassed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:13.65,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.40,0:11:16.15,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Train me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:17.90,main,Yor,0,0,0,,T-Train you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.69,0:11:22.07,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I know it's really dangerous to \Nbe an Eden student now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.07,0:11:26.54,main,Anya,0,0,0,,But it won't be as scary if I train!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:29.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I can do my best at school without dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:32.00,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I wanna be like you, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.29,0:11:36.96,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Even if I can't be like a normal mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:40.59,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm going to do everything I can for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.05,0:11:44.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,All right. Let's go straight \Nhome and start your training.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:45.01,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Training!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:50.36,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm home...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.89,0:11:52.85,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Hah! Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.02,0:11:55.23,main,Loid,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.23,0:11:56.73,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Preparing her to go to school!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.73,0:11:57.73,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.28,0:11:59.15,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:01.78,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Yeah... I'm filled with nothing but anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.53,0:12:00.24,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:01.78,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:02.70,top,Anya,0,0,0,,Hah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:08.45,main,Headmaster,0,0,0,,You are truly the chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:13.46,main,Headmaster,0,0,0,,Due to your hard work, or perhaps your parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:16.96,main,Headmaster,0,0,0,,you have made it to the \Nhallowed halls of Eden.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:21.88,main,Headmaster,0,0,0,,To our honorable new 228 students...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:24.30,main,Headmaster,0,0,0,,Congratulations, and welcome to our school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:27.81,main,Headmaster,0,0,0,,Everyone here at Eden welcomes you \Nfrom the bottom of our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:31.01,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,We finally made it this far...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.27,0:12:34.27,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Papa, a lot of people are \Nwearing the same thing I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:36.52,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Yes. That's what a uniform is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.52,0:12:39.07,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I still have a mountain of \Nproblems to tackle, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:41.44,flashback,Handler,0,0,0,,Listen up, Twilight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:44.82,flashback,Handler,0,0,0,,There are requirements to attend\N Desmond's social gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:48.24,flashback,Handler,0,0,0,,The student must be an Imperial Scholar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:51.58,flashback,Handler,0,0,0,,And for that to happen, they \Nmust receive plenty of merits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:56.84,flashback,Handler,0,0,0,,Do not forget that the future of the \NEast and West depends on this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.21,0:12:59.96,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Turning this child into an elite...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:02.59,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've mostly given up on that task.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:03.55,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:06.93,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,This school is already filled \Nwith the best of the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.93,0:13:09.72,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It'll be difficult to maintain a top position.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.72,0:13:10.64,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:15.81,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Next, we will announce the houses \Nand their housemasters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.81,0:13:18.02,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Please come forward when \Nyour name is called.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.02,0:13:20.65,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Class one: Specter Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.65,0:13:22.15,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,William Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.82,0:13:24.82,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Theodore Russell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:26.99,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Grace Fein.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.49,0:13:29.20,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Jessica Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:32.95,top,Instructor,0,0,0,,Next, we have class two: Cline Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.45,0:13:32.33,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I wonder what class I'm gonna be in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.33,0:13:33.75,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:35.21,top,Instructor,0,0,0,,Lucy Garrett.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:37.62,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Actually... I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.62,0:13:42.88,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Because I changed parts of the \Nlineups to help with my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:41.50,top,Instructor,0,0,0,,Class three: Cecile Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:43.84,top,Instructor,0,0,0,,Alice Paulette.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.76,0:13:45.63,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,To ensure that Anya...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.38,0:13:46.13,top,Instructor,0,0,0,,Edward Perkshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.55,0:13:48.30,top,Instructor,0,0,0,,Damian Desmond.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.30,0:13:49.80,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,would be in the same class as him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.75,0:13:54.60,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The second son of my target, \NDonovan Desmond...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.60,0:13:55.56,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Damian.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:58.07,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,That's Lord Damian to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.56,0:14:01.36,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,He got into Eden just \Nlike his older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.36,0:14:04.74,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I've had my eye on him ever since I saw \Nhis name on the list of students applying.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:05.57,top,Instructor,0,0,0,,Jesse Capel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:09.20,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,If plan A to get Anya to become an \NImperial Scholar proves too difficult,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:10.24,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,we'll go to plan B.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.57,0:14:13.33,italicstop,Loid,0,0,0,,I call it... the Friendship Scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:16.58,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,434)\pos(468,287)}{\pos(472,290)\fscx44}THE FRIENDSHIP SCHEME
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:17.54,italicstop,Loid,0,0,0,,Step one: be in the same class \Nas him and become friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.54,0:14:20.67,italicstop,Loid,0,0,0,,Step two: be invited to his \Nhouse and bring me along.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.62,0:14:20.29,sign_23950_248_Welcome,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz23.36\pos(285,220)\fad(233,1)}Come over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:23.75,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Step three: direct contact with the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.25,0:14:23.71,sign_23950_248_Welcome,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(311,92)\fad(1,730)}Welcome
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:23.71,sign_23950_248_Welcome,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(635,80,460,80,1,439)\an8\fad(1,730)}Thank\N you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.17,0:14:26.97,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm sure it won't actually go that easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.97,0:14:28.51,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,but the more insurance we have, the better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.84,0:14:29.68,top,Instructor,0,0,0,,Anya Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:31.51,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:38.27,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Anya must have grown up around kids \Nher age at the orphanage for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.64,0:14:41.52,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I'll put my faith in her \Ncommunication skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.31,0:14:44.44,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,That's the evil boss's kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.53,0:14:47.28,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,What's with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.28,0:14:48.77,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Heh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.32,0:14:52.32,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,She's already realized how \Namazing I am and fallen for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.49,0:14:54.49,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,You've got good taste, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:58.87,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Playing hard to get, I see. Cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:01.04,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,Becky Blackbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.04,0:15:01.83,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Geh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:03.79,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:07.26,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:10.68,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,The daughter of the CEO of the major\N military contractor, Blackbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:13.97,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What?! And behind her is the daughter \Nof the vice president of parliament!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:16.81,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,And among the boys, there's the son of one \Nof the key members of the secret service!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:19.77,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Her classmates are a \Ntreasure trove of intel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:22.65,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Make sure you become friends \Nwith all of them, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.06,0:15:26.14,italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Loid gets so worked up when \Nit comes to his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:28.86,main,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm Becky! What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.86,0:15:32.78,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,She looks like a baby. I guess I wouldn't \Nmind taking care of her a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:34.37,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.87,0:15:36.54,top,Instructor,0,0,0,,Those will be the 29 students in class three.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.37,0:15:35.20,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.20,0:15:36.24,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:39.71,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,And you will be under the \Ntutelage of Master Henderson.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:42.67,main,Yor,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the nice teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:44.79,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,So he didn't get fired after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:48.63,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,I feel it's unfair for a housemaster \Nto have to teach new students,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.63,0:15:51.38,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,but I guess it could've been much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.38,0:15:54.80,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,I'll just have to whip these rugrats \Ninto shape like I used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.89,0:15:59.24,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,And now, the new students will accompany their\N homeroom teachers on a tour of the campus,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.24,0:16:02.52,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,then head to their \Nrespective classrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:09.23,main,Instructor,0,0,0,,During that time, there will be a meet and \Ngreet in Tower C's lounge for the guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.23,0:16:10.78,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Do your best, Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.78,0:16:14.03,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,You'll be on your own from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.20,0:16:16.90,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Okey-dokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.90,0:16:19.13,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,You there! Stay in line!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:22.33,main,Loid,0,0,0,,I'm so worried...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:24.63,main,Yor,0,0,0,,It is always nerve-racking to send \Nthem off into the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:25.75,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I totally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.17,0:16:28.92,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,This is the dining hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:32.93,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,The best chefs will present you with \Nthe most elegant dishes daily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.38,0:16:38.56,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Beyond those doors is a special dining \Nhall reserved only for Imperial Scholars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.85,0:16:44.65,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Anyone can become an Imperial Scholar if they \Nachieve elegant grades and earn eight Stella.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.65,0:16:47.11,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I trust that you will all do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:48.15,main,Children,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.44,0:16:50.44,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,However, those who fall behind
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.44,0:16:54.49,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,will receive Tonitrus Bolts and face \Npunishment or expulsion, so stay on your toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:56.41,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:59.58,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Lord Damian's gonna be an \NImperial Scholar in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:00.91,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.91,0:17:02.54,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,We'd expect nothing else!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:05.58,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I mean, my father is the head \Nof the National Unity Party.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.58,0:17:06.92,main,Student A,0,0,0,,Wait, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:06.92,main,Student B,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:10.59,main,Student C,0,0,0,,My Papa says we owe a lot \Nto the Desmond Group!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:12.46,top,Henderson,0,0,0,,Silence! No private conversations!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:13.72,main,Becky,0,0,0,,They're so dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:20.56,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What about you? What does your father do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:23.93,main,Damian,0,0,0,,If he's important enough, I'd consider \Nletting you be my friend, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.73,0:17:27.27,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,I will stay calm for the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:29.69,main,Anya,0,0,0,,He's a sp—a feelings doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:32.74,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hmph. So he's just a nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.74,0:17:35.70,main,Damian,0,0,0,,You're probably not that rich, either. Lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.70,0:17:37.91,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I wanna go play at your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.91,0:17:40.66,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,You moron! Know your place, uggo!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:42.95,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,This is the problem with \Nmeasly little peasants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.95,0:17:45.46,main,Emile,0,0,0,,You're gonna get your gross \Npeasant germs on him! Scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.08,0:17:50.13,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Now is the time for me to\Nunleash my killer punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:51.71,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:52.46,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Gasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.46,0:17:55.17,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,Anyone who lets their \Nemotions control their fists
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.17,0:17:57.30,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,does not know the meaning of true strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:17:59.14,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,If someone's just being a little mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.14,0:18:01.85,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,being able to laugh it off \Nmakes you the cooler, bigger girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:03.43,flashback,Anya,0,0,0,,A big girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.43,0:18:07.55,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,And if you can keep a smile on \Nyour face, fights will not happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.55,0:18:11.52,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Hey, stop being so pathetic. \NAt least say something back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.52,0:18:14.53,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh. Like I care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.70,0:18:18.49,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.28,0:18:22.99,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,H-How dare she smirk at me \Nlike she's mocking me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.24,0:18:26.46,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Look at that composure! \NShe's so mature! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:28.75,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,I was wrong about her being a baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:32.29,main,Becky,0,0,0,,You're way more grown-up than \NI thought. I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:33.63,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm a grown-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:38.76,main,Anya,0,0,0,,Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:42.85,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky, you stupid uggo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.85,0:18:44.77,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Uggo, uggo, Queen Uggo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.77,0:18:47.39,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,Lord Damian, perhaps you should \Nbroaden your vocabulary...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.89,0:18:48.89,main,Becky,0,0,0,,What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.89,0:18:52.27,main,Becky,0,0,0,,Sure, she's uglier than me, \Nbut you don't have to be so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.27,0:18:53.65,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.65,0:18:55.90,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,You there! How many times must I warn you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.90,0:18:58.15,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Do you want punishments on your first day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.40,0:19:01.41,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,Curse you... How dare you \Nembarrass me like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.41,0:19:02.62,italics,Damian,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:06.58,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Mama, you liar. Smiling didn't help at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.46,0:19:17.67,main,Becky,0,0,0,,If you don't quit it, \NI'm gonna tell the teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.67,0:19:20.09,main,Damian,0,0,0,,What? You have proof that we did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.09,0:19:21.43,main,Ewen and Emile,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:23.18,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Go on. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.85,0:19:25.39,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey, you smug uggo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.18,0:19:29.73,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bully you every single day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.73,0:19:33.28,main,Damian,0,0,0,,I'm gonna teach you a lesson so you'll \Nnever be able to smirk again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:36.69,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Her feelings doctor father might \Nbe able to fix her if she cries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.03,0:19:39.40,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Seriously? Well, that's impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.78,0:19:41.76,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Aren't you a special widdle girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.16,0:19:46.84,main,Damian,0,0,0,,Hey, where do you think \Nyou're looking? You scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.67,0:20:00.09,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:03.26,main,Emile,0,0,0,,Sir! She just punched Lord Damian!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:06.64,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I just reached out my hand ,\Nand somehow, he ran into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.64,0:20:09.56,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,You liar! You're not fooling anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.56,0:20:12.81,main,Emile,0,0,0,,You were even making sure the \Nteacher wasn't looking earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.00,0:20:15.27,main,Anya,0,0,0,,You got any proof I did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.27,0:20:18.53,main,Ewen,0,0,0,,You left the imprint of \Nyour fist on his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.94,0:20:22.03,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I trust you are aware that \Nperjury is a disgraceful act,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.03,0:20:23.78,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Anya Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:27.28,main,Becky,0,0,0,,That's not what happened, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:30.87,main,Becky,0,0,0,,She was holding back all day, \Nbut these bullies just...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:34.25,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,So it's true that she hit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.21,0:20:38.05,flashback italics,Yor,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Miss Anya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.05,0:20:38.80,italics,Anya,0,0,0,,Gasp!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:42.22,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,The only time it's all right for \Nyou to use force is, for example,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.22,0:20:45.18,flashback,Yor,0,0,0,,if you're saving a friend in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.81,0:20:50.18,main,Anya,0,0,0,,H-Her foot...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:52.60,main,Anya,0,0,0,,He stepped on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.06,0:20:55.15,main,Anya,0,0,0,,So I got mad...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.60,0:20:57.23,main,Anya,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:00.86,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,She did that for me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.86,0:21:02.19,italics,Becky,0,0,0,,Oh, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:05.49,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,She held back her own personal anger,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:07.03,top,Becky,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you, Anya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.49,0:21:09.99,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,and had the courage to stand \Nup to a lad for her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:09.16,top,Becky,0,0,0,,I'm so moved!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.62,0:21:13.41,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,Truly elegant, Anya Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.11,0:21:15.58,italics,Henderson,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.25,0:21:19.75,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,So the Desmonds didn't appear after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.46,0:21:23.01,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Well, there's no need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.26,0:21:26.09,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,Now that she's enrolled, \Nwe have all the time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.51,0:21:26.14,top,Staff,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.14,0:21:30.49,top,Staff,0,0,0,,The students' orientation is now complete, \Nso please head toward the courtyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.51,0:21:28.93,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,And I was able to make some connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:33.73,top,Staff,0,0,0,,If you would gather round, \Nwe will take a group photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.93,0:21:34.44,main,Loid,0,0,0,,Where's Anya?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:35.48,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Forger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:37.27,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.86,0:21:39.90,main,Loid,0,0,0,,She punched a boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.23,0:21:42.19,top,Yor,0,0,0,,Are you hurt at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.19,0:21:43.74,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,And it just happened to be Desmond's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:46.91,top,Henderson,0,0,0,,Usually, acts of violence would \Nimmediately mean three Tonitrus Bolts...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.74,0:21:45.11,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:49.91,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,But at my discretion, it became one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.91,0:21:52.50,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,That is as much as I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.19,0:21:57.18,main,Yor,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, Loid! \NAll because I trained her...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.41,0:22:00.67,main,Henderson,0,0,0,,I will speak with his parents, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:08.22,sign_23950_248_Welcome,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(200,175)\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\fad(1,1023)}Plan A
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:08.22,sign_23950_248_Welcome,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\frz15.02\pos(95,280)\bord2\3c&HFFFFFF&\fad(1,1023)}Plan B
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.04,0:22:03.84,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,It's the first day of school \Nand she lost a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.84,0:22:06.82,italics,Loid,0,0,0,,To top it off, her relationship with \NDamian couldn't be any worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.80,0:22:11.30,main,Photographer,0,0,0,,All right, everyone! We're taking the picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:14.96,main,Photographer,0,0,0,,The family on the right over there!\N Smile a little more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:16.80,main,Photographer,0,0,0,,Say, "Cheese!"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.65,0:22:29.99,sign_18354_242_This_assignment_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H212121&\3c&HE8E8E8&\bord4\pos(25,145)\fs11\fad(357,1)}Stella needed to become an Imperial Scholar: 8\NTonitrus Bolts until expulsion: 7\NRelationship with Damian: -100
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.05,0:24:09.91,sign_6041_79_OPERATION_STRIX,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fscx44\pos(470,278)}THE TARGET'S SECOND SON
